WEBVTT

00:06:01.204 --> 00:06:04.371
This moment builds on the choices
of leaders I met,

00:06:04.413 --> 00:06:07.413
as I traveled with
the United Nations before lockdown.

00:06:08.121 --> 00:06:10.579
Leaders who choose
to do things differently.

00:06:10.954 --> 00:06:13.913
Costa Rica made a choice
to abolish its army

00:06:13.954 --> 00:06:16.663
and redirect military spending
to education, health

00:06:16.704 --> 00:06:18.038
and the environment.

00:06:18.038 --> 00:06:20.788
Today, they pay people
to protect the trees.

00:06:20.788 --> 00:06:21.954
And as a result,

00:06:21.996 --> 00:06:26.288
forests have regenerated
and now cover over half of the country.

00:06:26.288 --> 00:06:27.871
Or consider Denmark.

00:06:27.871 --> 00:06:30.371
It has chosen to produce
all of its electricity